+# Independent filesystem type compatibility
+
+This project-authored package describes the three public structural interfaces
+used by @humanfs/core 0.19.2 and @humanfs/node 0.16.8 through @humanfs/types 0.15.0.
+It contains declarations only, with no executable entrypoint. It was independently
+authored from recorded public API facts; it does not relicense supplier code.
+
+All implementation methods are optional. Paths accept strings or URLs; write and
+append take bytes. Directory and walk entries retain required metadata fields.
+The unchanged strict positive/negative contract is tested against both original
+and replacement declarations, including public parent declaration consumers.
+
+The complete project AGPL-3.0-or-later grant is in LICENSE.
